{"page":185,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"178","words":[{"text":"178","x":165,"y":134,"width":73,"height":34}]},{"text":"CHAPTER 03 • 트랜스포트 계층","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER","x":555,"y":132,"width":127,"height":25},{"text":"03","x":694,"y":132,"width":34,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":763,"y":138,"width":12,"height":12},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":808,"y":134,"width":136,"height":28},{"text":"계층","x":957,"y":135,"width":54,"height":30}]},{"text":"보낸다. 트랜스포트 계층 세그먼트의 데이터를 올바른 소켓으로 전달하는 작업을 역다","words":[{"text":"보낸다.","x":532,"y":259,"width":110,"height":37},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":656,"y":259,"width":175,"height":37},{"text":"계층","x":846,"y":260,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"세그먼트의","x":927,"y":260,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"데이터를","x":1118,"y":260,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"올바른","x":1271,"y":260,"width":107,"height":36},{"text":"소켓으로","x":1391,"y":258,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"전달하는","x":1550,"y":257,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"작업을","x":1707,"y":256,"width":107,"height":37},{"text":"역다","x":1828,"y":258,"width":63,"height":42}]},{"text":"중화(demultiplexing)라고 한다. 출발지 호스트에서 소켓으로부터 데이터를 모으고,","words":[{"text":"중화(demultiplexing)라고","x":530,"y":319,"width":421,"height":41},{"text":"한다.","x":968,"y":320,"width":79,"height":37},{"text":"출발지","x":1067,"y":320,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"호스트에서","x":1190,"y":318,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"소켓으로부터","x":1385,"y":319,"width":212,"height":37},{"text":"데이터를","x":1621,"y":317,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"모으고,","x":1783,"y":320,"width":107,"height":40}]},{"text":"이에 대한 세그먼트를 생성하기 위해서 각 데이터에 헤더 정보(니중에 역다중화에 사","words":[{"text":"이에","x":531,"y":378,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"대한","x":615,"y":379,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트를","x":698,"y":379,"width":174,"height":37},{"text":"생성하기","x":887,"y":379,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"위해서","x":1042,"y":379,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"각","x":1163,"y":379,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"데이터에","x":1213,"y":378,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"헤더","x":1370,"y":379,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"정보(니중에","x":1459,"y":379,"width":190,"height":39},{"text":"역다중화에","x":1670,"y":377,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"사","x":1859,"y":384,"width":33,"height":37}]},{"text":"용된다)로 캡슐화하괴 그 세그먼트들을 네트워크 계층으로 전달하는 작업을 다중화","words":[{"text":"용된다)로","x":528,"y":438,"width":154,"height":39},{"text":"캡슐화하괴","x":701,"y":439,"width":179,"height":37},{"text":"그","x":899,"y":444,"width":34,"height":26},{"text":"세그먼트들을","x":951,"y":439,"width":211,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크","x":1181,"y":439,"width":140,"height":37},{"text":"계층으로","x":1341,"y":439,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"전달하는","x":1503,"y":440,"width":143,"height":37},{"text":"작업을","x":1665,"y":439,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"다중화","x":1791,"y":438,"width":100,"height":45}]},{"text":"(multiplexing)라고 한다. 그림 3.2에서 중간 호스트의 트랜스포트 계층은 네트워크","words":[{"text":"(multiplexing)라고","x":528,"y":498,"width":311,"height":42},{"text":"한다.","x":856,"y":498,"width":77,"height":38},{"text":"그림","x":953,"y":499,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"3.2에서","x":1040,"y":499,"width":117,"height":38},{"text":"중간","x":1179,"y":499,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"호스트의","x":1266,"y":499,"width":141,"height":37},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1428,"y":500,"width":180,"height":36},{"text":"계층은","x":1628,"y":501,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크","x":1755,"y":501,"width":134,"height":38}]},{"text":"계층 아래로부터 수신한 세그먼트를 위쪽의 프로세스 터 또는 P2로 반드시 역 다중화","words":[{"text":"계층","x":529,"y":558,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"아래로부터","x":612,"y":558,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"수신한","x":798,"y":558,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"세그먼트를","x":919,"y":559,"width":174,"height":37},{"text":"위쪽의","x":1108,"y":559,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스","x":1228,"y":559,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"터","x":1385,"y":564,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"또는","x":1437,"y":562,"width":74,"height":35},{"text":"P2로","x":1525,"y":564,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"반드시","x":1615,"y":561,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"역","x":1741,"y":562,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"다중화","x":1790,"y":562,"width":100,"height":42}]},{"text":"해야만 한다. 이것은 도착한 세그먼트의 데이터를, 이에 상응하는 프로세스의 소켓으","words":[{"text":"해야만","x":527,"y":618,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":647,"y":619,"width":75,"height":37},{"text":"이것은","x":743,"y":618,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"도착한","x":860,"y":619,"width":107,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트의","x":982,"y":619,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"데이터를,","x":1174,"y":619,"width":148,"height":39},{"text":"이에","x":1342,"y":620,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"상응하는","x":1428,"y":621,"width":146,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스의","x":1590,"y":623,"width":179,"height":38},{"text":"소켓으","x":1789,"y":624,"width":99,"height":37}]},{"text":"로 전달되도록 해서 이루어진다. 또한 중간 호스트의 트랜스포트 계층은 프로세스의","words":[{"text":"로","x":525,"y":682,"width":35,"height":27},{"text":"전달되도록","x":579,"y":679,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"해서","x":768,"y":678,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"이루어진다.","x":854,"y":679,"width":181,"height":38},{"text":"또한","x":1054,"y":681,"width":72,"height":36},{"text":"중간","x":1142,"y":680,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"호스트의","x":1230,"y":681,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1390,"y":681,"width":180,"height":37},{"text":"계층은","x":1590,"y":683,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스의","x":1715,"y":684,"width":170,"height":42}]},{"text":"소켓으로부터 바깥으로 나기는 데이터를 모으고, 디음엔 트랜스포트 계층 세그먼트들","words":[{"text":"소켓으로부터","x":525,"y":738,"width":203,"height":38},{"text":"바깥으로","x":748,"y":739,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"나기는","x":901,"y":739,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"데이터를","x":1022,"y":741,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"모으고,","x":1176,"y":743,"width":114,"height":36},{"text":"디음엔","x":1309,"y":741,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1429,"y":742,"width":182,"height":36},{"text":"계층","x":1628,"y":744,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트들","x":1716,"y":745,"width":172,"height":42}]},{"text":"로 만들괴 이들 세그먼트를 아래 네트워크 계층으로 전달해야만 한다. 비록 인터넷 트","words":[{"text":"로","x":524,"y":802,"width":34,"height":27},{"text":"만들괴","x":572,"y":799,"width":112,"height":37},{"text":"이들","x":700,"y":799,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트를","x":781,"y":799,"width":174,"height":39},{"text":"아래","x":968,"y":800,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"네트워크","x":1051,"y":801,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"계층으로","x":1206,"y":802,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"전달해야만","x":1362,"y":803,"width":179,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":1554,"y":803,"width":80,"height":39},{"text":"비록","x":1653,"y":805,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"인터넷","x":1740,"y":805,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"트","x":1856,"y":813,"width":31,"height":29}]},{"text":"랜스포트 프로토콜의 내용에서 다중화와 역다중회를 설명했지만, 이들은 한 계층(트랜","words":[{"text":"랜스포트","x":526,"y":859,"width":137,"height":36},{"text":"프로토콜의","x":675,"y":860,"width":170,"height":37},{"text":"내용에서","x":863,"y":861,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"다중화와","x":1014,"y":862,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"역다중회를","x":1170,"y":863,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"설명했지만,","x":1360,"y":864,"width":187,"height":38},{"text":"이들은","x":1565,"y":864,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"한","x":1686,"y":866,"width":37,"height":35},{"text":"계층(트랜","x":1738,"y":866,"width":147,"height":42}]},{"text":"스포트 계층이나 그 밖의 계수에서의 한 프로토콜이 그 상위 계층의 여러 프로토콜에","words":[{"text":"스포트","x":523,"y":922,"width":105,"height":30},{"text":"계층이나","x":643,"y":920,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":792,"y":926,"width":35,"height":26},{"text":"밖의","x":841,"y":921,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"계수에서의","x":925,"y":923,"width":182,"height":39},{"text":"한","x":1125,"y":924,"width":37,"height":36},{"text":"프로토콜이","x":1174,"y":925,"width":174,"height":37},{"text":"그","x":1366,"y":930,"width":35,"height":25},{"text":"상위","x":1415,"y":924,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"계층의","x":1504,"y":925,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"여러","x":1627,"y":925,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"프로토콜에","x":1713,"y":929,"width":170,"height":39}]},{"text":"의해 시용될 때마다 관련된다는 것을 알아두기 바란다.","words":[{"text":"의해","x":524,"y":982,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"시용될","x":605,"y":982,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"때마다","x":722,"y":982,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"관련된다는","x":836,"y":983,"width":176,"height":39},{"text":"것을","x":1025,"y":985,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"알아두기","x":1107,"y":985,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"바란다.","x":1261,"y":985,"width":113,"height":38}]},{"text":"역다중화 작업을 설명하기 위해서, 이전 절에서 예제로 설명한 집안의 비유를 다","words":[{"text":"역다중화","x":593,"y":1044,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"작업을","x":745,"y":1044,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"설명하기","x":864,"y":1045,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"위해서,","x":1019,"y":1046,"width":111,"height":38},{"text":"이전","x":1150,"y":1047,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"절에서","x":1236,"y":1047,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"예제로","x":1358,"y":1047,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"설명한","x":1482,"y":1047,"width":110,"height":37},{"text":"집안의","x":1608,"y":1047,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"비유를","x":1735,"y":1047,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"다","x":1854,"y":1051,"width":31,"height":37}]},{"text":"시 보자. 각각의 아이는 이름으로 구별된다. 빌이 우편집배원으로부터 우편 한 묶음을","words":[{"text":"시","x":524,"y":1106,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"보자.","x":571,"y":1106,"width":77,"height":38},{"text":"각각의","x":666,"y":1106,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"아이는","x":783,"y":1106,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"이름으로","x":901,"y":1106,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"구별된다.","x":1054,"y":1107,"width":147,"height":38},{"text":"빌이","x":1221,"y":1107,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"우편집배원으로부터","x":1303,"y":1107,"width":322,"height":39},{"text":"우편","x":1645,"y":1107,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"한","x":1734,"y":1107,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"묶음을","x":1784,"y":1108,"width":101,"height":40}]},{"text":"받았을 때, 그는 그 우편물이 누구에게 온 것인지를 살펴 부 구, 그 우편물을 그의 형제","words":[{"text":"받았을","x":523,"y":1167,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"때,","x":642,"y":1168,"width":42,"height":38},{"text":"그는","x